WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.700
Open the Calendar (⇧⌘C)

2
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.200
Open the wand's menu

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.800
Replan My Week…

4
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.300
A block that passed without work comes off…

5
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.800
…and the work goes back into this week's free time

6
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.500
Every move is a checkbox — then Apply

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:36.000
The week is planned again — drag any block to adjust it
